---
description: |
  Matches events against the SOC Prime behavior rules.

  The operator runs the Sigma rules of the bundled SOC Prime detection
  content with the `sigma` operator and emits an OCSF Detection Finding per
  match. The rules match OCSF events through the Sigma-to-OCSF mapping of the
  `sigma` operator. The operator leaves out the rules in
  `socprime::$unsupported`, whose fields have no OCSF representation.
---

let $ocsf_rules = socprime::$rules.entries().where(rule => not socprime::$unsupported.has(rule.key))
sigma rules=$ocsf_rules.map(rule => rule.value)
